New in 1.1.0:
- Room model from all data: heat-up times from the first week on, a 12-hour forecast in the room chart and a simulated day for both models.
- Probe run as a hit rate with a deviation chart; the better model is shown per room.
- Fewer false open-window detections.
- Heating profiles: undo asks first, new phases go after the last one, only changed days are copied to other rooms.
